{"id":"6506f34033bb0739","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-thm-indescribable.md","title":"Indescribable Cardinal","display":"thm-indescribable — Indescribable Cardinal","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-indescribable","aliases":["58-thm-indescribable"],"display":"thm-indescribable — Indescribable Cardinal","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-indescribable.md]]","[[58-df-hierarchy]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-indescribable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-indescribable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-indescribable — Indescribable Cardinal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ed949cc2262231c7\" href=\"?note=ed949cc2262231c7\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-indescribable.md\">../batch16/58-df-indescribable.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"19e9a8c33d5c841c\" href=\"?note=19e9a8c33d5c841c\" title=\"58-df-hierarchy\">58-df-hierarchy</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,n\\in\\omega\">\\(m,n\\in\\omega\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in V\">\\(\\kappa\\in V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq V_\\kappa\">\\(A\\subseteq V_\\kappa\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\Pi^n_m\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\Pi^n_m\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\Pi^n_m}\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\Pi^n_m}\\subseteq V\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}indescribable} \\vdash \\mathrm{Ind}_{\\Pi^n_m}(\\kappa)\\land V_\\kappa\\models\\varphi(A)\\to\\exists\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\;(V_\\alpha\\models\\varphi(A\\cap V_\\alpha))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}indescribable} \\vdash \\mathrm{Ind}_{\\Pi^n_m}(\\kappa)\\land V_\\kappa\\models\\varphi(A)\\to\\exists\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\;(V_\\alpha\\models\\varphi(A\\cap V_\\alpha))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>“Indescribable” denotes the displayed reflection scheme; it does not assert that the cardinal lacks a first-order description.</li>\n<li>Weakly compact cardinals are <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^1_1\">\\(\\Pi^1_1\\)</span>-indescribable.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-indescribable.md","status":"resolved","id":"ed949cc2262231c7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-indescribable.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"19e9a8c33d5c841c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-hierarchy]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"m,n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq V_\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\Pi^n_m","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\Pi^n_m}\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}indescribable} \\vdash \\mathrm{Ind}_{\\Pi^n_m}(\\kappa)\\land V_\\kappa\\models\\varphi(A)\\to\\exists\\alpha<\\kappa\\;(V_\\alpha\\models\\varphi(A\\cap V_\\alpha))","display":true},{"tex":"\\Pi^1_1","display":false}],"bytes":855,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4224","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58